This project bundles or depends on third-party work under its own terms:

- Detector training data: Roboflow Universe datasets, CC BY 4.0.
- Algorithm references: josephattalla/Basketball-Shot-Detection (MIT) and
  Ed-Zh/Basketball-Analytics (MIT).
- Bundled model weights in assets/models/ carry their own licences: the
  default YOLOX-Nano detector and the MoveNet pose model are Apache-2.0,
  while the non-default YOLO11 fallback detector is AGPL-3.0 and is not
  covered by the MIT grant above.

The authoritative list is src/core/legalCredits.ts, which also drives the
in-app credits screen. See docs/MODELS.md for dataset detail.
